Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! \NYou're coming around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:34.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:27.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you back to normal right away, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-san, what in the world \Nhappened at the 5th Laboratory?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:43.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:46.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing much? And you were this seriously injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, and I was just one step away from getting my hand on the truth, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:04.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, next time, I won't botch things—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.27,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Edward-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I apologize in advance \Nfor my discourtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You nearly lost your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:21.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should recognize that you are still a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could trust us adults \Na little more, couldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My conduct was unbecoming of an inferior officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I beg your forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I beg your forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the one \Nwho's sorry to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:47.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is one of Ed's parts, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:54.64,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,As someone who's been sung of as \Na young, beautiful, gifted Automail engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.64,0:03:57.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this is a terrible blunder for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:59.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:02.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, no! N-Nothing at all, nothing at all, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Rockbell Prosthetic-Limb Outfitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:11.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, I can't move my right arm anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:16.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:18.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you that I made it lighter, \Nso it wouldn't be quite so strong this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you've gone and done something reckless again, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Anyhow, I can't get down there right now, so I'm in a fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:34.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll make the trip! \NI'll dash on over, just wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you unusually kind today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm always kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:43.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, if you would. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:51.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time, make sure you do his maintenance right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:52.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo, Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:13.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard you could get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, are you okay too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you guys go buy some lunch for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:26.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'll get that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:27.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Ross, you go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:33.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm just so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About the 5th Laboratory...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything that happened \Nconcerning the incident there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is being chalked up as the doing of Scar, \Nwho was pursuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.07,0:05:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, \NI'm not convinced of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were a lot of bodies left there \Nthat are thought to have been Chimeras.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:07.37,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,And a great deal of equipment that I can't help but believe was still operational until just yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:11.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Among the prisoners who were \Nforcibly taken there by someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:14.81,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,there are those who said they saw Brig. Gen. Basque Grand, who was killed in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:17.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.91,0:06:23.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just tell me what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Homunculi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:41.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:43.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they definitely weren't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're tied in with the \NPhilosopher's Stone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:59.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were trying to make me create a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And by using live prisoners, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A guardian who was only a spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A dangerous guy named Envy or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:29.51,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Not to mention Philosopher's Stone transmutation circles and Uroboros tattoos...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw all of them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For experiments about a lousy stone, \Nnone of those are laughing matters, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard from Marcoh-san
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:42.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that Philosopher's Stones were used in the Eastern Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said that for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was being kept alive \Nfor their sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:56.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me handle it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, you should just think about yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.85,0:08:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he was going to have a sign or something ready for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if it isn't Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:28.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking \Nthe trouble to come so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:30.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way... I hadn't heard \Nthat you were in a hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:40.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, one thing led to another...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to laugh about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:43.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't maintain you properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:49.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and now, this has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't particularly your fault! \NRight, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.73,0:08:54.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:59.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your maintenance was perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, sometimes it just happens to stop moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the timing had been different, \Nwhat happened might've been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:10.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the reason it broke was because \NI was using it too roughly in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:14.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could it be that he hasn't noticed \Nthat I forgot to tighten that screw?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, sure! \NEd, you're always too rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:20.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:32.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Lt. Colonel, \Nthere's a phone call from Colonel Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo! You called at a good time! \NI have great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:40.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You found Scar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:43.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?! How would that be great news?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:48.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is Elicia-chan's birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to turn into charcoal, report your current situation immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:54.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not to worry. \NIf anything happens, I'll contact you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:57.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, be sure to send Elicia-chan a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, are you sure it's okay not to report anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, he doesn't \Nneed to know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:14.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, how are \Nthose reports I requested?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Working without rest, \NI've finally finished them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:29.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are you doing, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:32.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you know, \Nyou're done eating already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:33.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, \Nlet me fix you right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You left your milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, anything but that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:49.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?! Milk is good for the body! Drink it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! \NIf I hate it, I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not drinking my milk isn't \Nparticularly going to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:55.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, jeez! This is the reason why you're always going to be such a bean sprout!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:57.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bean sprout?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:57.59,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,That's right, bean sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:10:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.64,0:11:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, Brother. \NYou have to drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:08.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Good for you, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:11.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got all big without \Nhaving to drink this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:18.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,didn't get this body \Nbecause I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter between you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:28.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:41.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come you never talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About your injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:46.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or about the two of you? \NHere I am, worried sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:49.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you won't talk to me \Nabout anything important?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed! Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:58.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:04.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo! Nice to meet you, Winry-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:07.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Lt. Col. Maes Hughes. \NIt's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:09.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:12.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is my adorable Elicia-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:15.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about it? Cute, right? \NYou'd like to meet her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! \NI'll let you meet her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll look after Winry-chan! Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:26.29,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,You are so lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:30.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, tomorrow is \NElicia-chan's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, so is Ed's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to get \Na present for him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what kind of present \Nare you going to give Elicia-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:45.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? A stuffed teddy bear? And a giant-size one, at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elicia-chan will be thrilled with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:01.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Elicia-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:02.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:03.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Elicia-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:04.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.23,0:13:07.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see, apples are best \Nif you coat them with syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.61,0:13:08.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's how you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lately, my own daughter has been...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice, Elicia-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a cute bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:15.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elicia-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's your present.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Miss Bookworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:24.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bookworm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.65,0:13:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.35,0:13:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elicia-chan, can you tell me how old you are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:41.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:43.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss, know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations! \NCongratulations! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Know what? Papa says the more people say "congratulations" to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the more good things \Nwill happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm telling you too, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elicia-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two almost look \Nlike you're siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really. I wish I had \Na little sister like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm an only child, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:11.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do have brothers, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:16.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brothers would talk to me \Nmore about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For a long time now, they've never talked about anything important with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:22.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't help that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:26.13,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Guys are creatures that demonstrate things more by their actions than with their words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As much as possible, they don't want to burden anyone with their adversities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nor do they want to worry others. \NThat's why they bottle everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.62,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,And even so, when those two \Nfinally do give in and complain,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:41.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you're the \Nonly one they do it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:46.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When that happens, \Nyou're the one who receives them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If their older sister \Nmakes that kind of face,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the younger brothers won't ever \Ncome to depend on her, will they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:58.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hughes-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.89,0:15:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting. I've finished \Nbaking a birthday cake for Ed-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:09.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Hughes-san, don't you have a present for Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no present that's a match for your smiling face, Winry-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations! \NCongratulations! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:38.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Know what? \NThey say that on your birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the more you get told "congratulations," the happier you'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here. This is from Gracia-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made sure to learn \Nhow to make it from her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:55.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so once you're able to eat, \NI can make it for you at any time, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:57.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:15:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, \Nwhen we were kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the three of us always \Nused to eat cake together, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. And that one time, Den ate Al's cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then Al bawled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:09.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:12.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were still little. \NDon't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:21.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:26.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be outside until you \Nfinish repairing Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure \Nyou're okay out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:34.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:37.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll come back \Nto get you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:38.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:48.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Ed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.87,0:16:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,something happened \Nbetween you and Al, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.09,0:16:54.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.87,0:16:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,did something awful to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:03.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had the chance to \Nreturn him back to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I hesitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:12.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would have had to \Nsacrifice other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In comparison with Al,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they should have been people who I didn't care about...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.75,0:17:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,while he watched from the sidelines...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's good that you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, Al wouldn't be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.77,0:17:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if someone else \Nended up being sacrificed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even if it did mean \Nhe could return to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:45.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, \NI wonder if Al isn't upset
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,over seeing you about to sacrifice someone even once, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suppose your personality and memories
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were implanted in you \Nas it suited your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(4550,5040,\1c&HFFFFFF&,\3c&HFFFFFF&,\4c&HFFFFFF&)}These people are all homunculi—\Nperfectly created humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:13.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was I ever really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:22.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go see Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:25.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what do I say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.95,0:18:27.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:30.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just say "sorry" \Nand apologize to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:32.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're always stuck for words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:46.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:48.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, I brought a bunch of stuff from Resembool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:19:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:02.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll do things our way
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and get ourselves back to normal for sure, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can get back to normal like that, Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I wonder if the same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:20.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course it does. Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:44.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.15,0:19:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the way you bonded my soul to this armor back then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Along with my memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:20:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Memories are nothing more than simply information, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.04,0:20:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An alchemist as good as you, Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:07.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,would have no trouble concocting a person's memories, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:11.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what you've been ruminating about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.75,0:20:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.81,0:20:17.76,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Earlier in Resembool, there was something you were about to tell me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.76,0:20:20.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something you were too afraid to say to me till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was that my soul and \Nmemories and everything
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are really something fake that you came up with, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! What Ed wanted \Nto say to you was—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:35.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.49,0:20:42.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, the person named Alphonse Elric \Nnever existed in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! \NYou two have always been together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, there's been me \Nand Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Believe me, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:54.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would you have me believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:59.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would you have me believe, with this hollow body?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's possible that all of you are deceiving me together, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.21,0:21:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,been keeping that \Nto yourself all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you, Brother?! Answer my question!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say anything?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:26.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no point in me living!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You stupid jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:32.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:35.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.47,0:21:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:50.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.01,0:21:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:21:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.32,0:22:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.09,0:22:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.51,0:22:11.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(1330,2300,\1c&H000000&,\3c&H000000&,\4c&H000000&)}Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.61,0:23:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.20,0:23:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 24: "Bonding Memories"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if everybody else has forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your warmth...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.51,0:23:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your smile...
